\subsubsection{Resource Retrieval and Filtering (RQ2)}
Table \ref{tab:retrieval_quality} presents resource retrieval metrics. Multi-source retrieval achieved high coverage across text, video, and code resources, with the AI-domain filter successfully removing 34\% of initially retrieved candidates as irrelevant. Precision@5 averaged 0.72, indicating that top recommendations were generally relevant to the learner's corpus.

