\subsection{Ablation Study: Pipeline Component Contributions}

To isolate the contribution of each pipeline component, we conducted an ablation study where we systematically removed: (A) MMR diversity selection, (B) AI-domain filtering, (C) CBF ranking, and (D) LLM summarization. Table \ref{tab:ablation} shows the results.

\begin{table}[!t]
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.2}
